  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n* Replace MultiDynamicResourceExtension with ResourceProvider for Background lookup by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/68\n* Remove DialogOverlayPopupHost ContentPresenter background which shoul… by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/70\n* Fix popup focusing and focus escaping when no focusable controls in popup by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/72\n* Increase initial scale for animation, to hide lags when dialog opened by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/77\n* Refactors some places, adds xmldoc by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/78\n* Adds the background blur effect by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/79\n* Replaces PART_DialogHostRoot Grid with Panel to simplify calculations by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/80\n* Some fixes in demo by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/pull/81\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AvaloniaUtils/DialogHost.Avalonia/compare/v0.8.1...v0.9.0",
